## 🧩 Domain Layer

The `domain` package contains the application's core models and metadata-related logic.

### Metadata

```text
domain/metadata/
├── ExifInspector.kt
├── ExifReader.kt
└── MetadataFormatter.kt
```

- `ExifReader` reads EXIF information from the selected image.
- `ExifInspector` provides metadata inspection utilities.
- `MetadataFormatter` converts raw metadata into user-friendly photographic values.

### Models

```text
domain/model/
└── PhotoMetadata.kt
```

`PhotoMetadata` represents the metadata extracted from a photograph.

### Editor Models

```text
domain/editor/model/
├── PhotoEdit.kt
├── FrameConfig.kt
├── TextElement.kt
├── LogoElement.kt
├── MetadataDisplayConfig.kt
└── MetadataField.kt
```

These models represent the editing configuration and the elements that will eventually be rendered into the exported photograph.

---

## 🎨 UI Layer

The UI is implemented using **Jetpack Compose**.

### Components

Reusable UI components are located in:

```text
ui/components/
├── MetadataRow.kt
├── MetadataSection.kt
└── PhotoPreview.kt
```

### Editor

The editor is responsible for displaying the photograph and configuring the information shown over or around it.

```text
ui/editor/
├── EditorScreen.kt
├── EditorPreview.kt
├── EditorUiState.kt
├── EditorViewModel.kt
└── MetadataFieldSwitch.kt
```

### Main Screen

```text
ui/screen/
├── FrameoraScreen.kt
├── FrameoraUiState.kt
└── FrameoraViewModel.kt
```

### Theme

```text
ui/theme/
├── Color.kt
├── Theme.kt
└── Type.kt
```

